 twist on meaningful accessories, we aim for Nominal to be a community of people from all around the globe, united by the beautiful opportunity of showcasing your true colors through jewelry.<br><br>Wear jewelry proudly. <br><br>Wear identity proudly.<br><br><a href="https://nominalx.com/pages/order-page" target="_self" style="color: rgb(216, 168, 89);">Express Your Identity</a></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-1a87" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-uojGG cmSGgF pf-292_ pf-hide"><div class="sc-ilfuhL bpQaoh"><div class="sc-ikJyIC iIcPdk pf-293_ pf-r pf-c-cm pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fHeRUh hpWXZa pf-294_ pf-bg-lazy"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2556/8900/t/83/assets/column11-1635449876719_500x.png?v=1635449878" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2556/8900/t/83/assets/column11-1635449876719.png?v=1635449878 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2556/8900/t/83/assets/column11-1635449876719_500x.png?v=1635449878 320w" width="679" height="551" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, 320px" loading="lazy" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-GEbAx hdezgK pf-295_"/></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fHeRUh hpWXZa pf-296_"><p class="sc-xiLah fvOkQT pf-297_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-299_">Nominal was founded by wife and husband, Lena &amp; Akram Abdallah, to give people an avenue to express their language, culture, or values. <br><br>&nbsp;"Inspired by the gorgeous Arabic language and culture all around the world, my wife and I found it incredibly difficult to express that love for the culture. What started off as a home decor art idea transformed into what you see today. We've always believed art ins't just for the home...it's for the soul, too. Now, you can carry that beautiful culture wherever you are. And that's how Nominal was born."
