ragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-397_">WE KNOW JEWELRY</span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-jUosCB gcYDfN pf-398_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-400_">Perfection From Start</span></h3><div class="sc-ikJyIC iIcPdk pf-401_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:30px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fHeRUh hpWXZa pf-402_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2556/8900/t/83/assets/screenshot20211007at40117pm-1635450890702_280x.jpg?v=1635450892" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2556/8900/t/83/assets/screenshot20211007at40117pm-1635450890702.jpg?v=1635450892 1536w" width="280" height="280" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, 320px" loading="lazy" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-GEbAx hdezgK pf-403_"/><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-eLwHnm livxj pf-404_"></div><p class="sc-xiLah fvOkQT pf-407_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-409_">Submerged In Water</span></p><p class="sc-xiLah fvOkQT pf-410_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-412_">Before we began to start manufacturing our necklaces, we submerged the finished products in a tank of water for 30 days. </span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fHeRUh hpWXZa pf-413_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2556/8900/t/83/assets/b1-1635451203872_280x.png?v=1635451205" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2556/8900/t/83/assets/b1-1635451203872.png?v=1635451205 1536w" width="280" height="280" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, 320px" loading="lazy" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-GEbAx hdezgK pf-414_"/><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-eLwHnm livxj pf-415_"></div><p class="sc-xiLah fvOkQT