ven further. </span></p><a href="https://nominalx.com/collections/custom/products/custom-name-necklace" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-jIkXHa euoiRq pf-470_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-472_"><span style="font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Yes! I'm Ready To Customize My Necklace Now!</span></span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-9ce5" data-pf-type="Section" id="faq2" class="sc-uojGG cmSGgF pf-473_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-ilfuhL bpQaoh"><div class="sc-ikJyIC iIcPdk pf-474_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fHeRUh hpWXZa pf-475_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-jUosCB gcYDfN pf-476_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-478_"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Frequently Asked Questions</span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-ikJyIC iIcPdk pf-479_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fHeRUh hpWXZa pf-480_"><div data-scrolling="false" data-multiple="false" data-pf-type="Accordion" class="sc-bYoBSM bChNIH pf-481_"><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kLwhqv julQCc pf-482_"><button type="button" class="sc-giYglK gvnqsv pf-483_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="77f84dba-331e-4926-bc0d-20d8ef2128f1" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>What is NOMINAL?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="77f84dba-331e-4926-bc0d-20d8ef2128f1" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-ezbkAF ikwrMb pf-485_"><p class="sc-xiLah fvOkQT pf-486_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-488_">Nominal™ is the beautiful outward expression of Arabic culture. Your Custom Name Necklace symbolizes your sense of pride in the person you are and hope to become. Not only meant for the celebratory highs of your life, Nominal is designed with the intent to provide a sense of resilience in the trying lows, too. From patience to love to trust... display the virtues that you love. </span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kLwhqv julQCc pf-489_"><button type="button" class="sc-giYglK gvnqsv pf-490_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="2d391e64-a912-4f4a-b080-effa3cc99816" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>I don't how to spell the name I want. Can you help?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="2d391e64-a912-4f4a-b080-effa3cc99816" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-ezbkAF ikwrMb pf-492_"><p class="sc-xiLah fvOkQT pf-493_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-495_">Absolutely, we can help! Feel free to choose your language of choice and proceed to enter the name in English. We send out a spelling confirmation to let you confirm or correct the spelling for your piece before we begin the production process, so be sure to keep an eye on your email and we'll help to get the best and most accurate spelling for you!</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kLwhqv julQCc pf-496_"><button type="button" class="sc-giYglK gvnqsv pf-497_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="e5488b70-0b39-4d2d-b91e-64a912bf4ab0" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Can I personalize my necklace in a different language?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="e5488b70-0b39-4d2d-b91e-64a912bf4ab0" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-ezbkAF ikwrMb pf-499_"><p class="sc-xiLah fvOkQT pf-500_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-502_">Yes! We're happy to bring your necklace to life in whatever language you'd prefer!
<br><br>Simply select "English" and then add your language of choice in your Order Notes at checkout. We'll create it handmade just for you and confirm the spelling via email before we make it!</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kLwhqv julQCc pf-503_"><button type="button" class="sc-giYglK gvnqsv pf-504_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="349f1f2c-6a5e-43e5-888b-700b39fd2d39" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>What materials does Nominal use for their jewelry?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="349f1f2c-6a5e-43e5-888b-700b39fd2d39" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-ezbkAF ikwrMb pf-506_"><p class="sc-xiLah fvOkQT pf-507_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-509_">All of our gold-plated jewelry is proudly coated with four layers of real 18 karat gold plating and powder-coated to ensure a life-long sheen. No matter what color necklace you choose (gold, rose gold, or silver), each necklace is filled with the most recycled metal on the planet: Stainless steel. On top of its sustainability, stainless steel is also the most water-resistant metal which makes your jewelry waterproof, sweat-proof, and truly everyday-proof. </span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kLwhqv julQCc pf-510_"><button type="button" class="sc-giYglK gvnqsv pf-511_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="f8288ea3-e99c-4fbe-8316-b83026ba55de" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>How should I take care of my necklace?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="f8288ea3-e99c-4fbe-8316-b83026ba55de" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-ezbkAF ikwrMb pf-513_"><p class="sc-xiLah fvOkQT pf-514_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-516_">While we proudly claim a Lifetime Warranty on all of our products, we still think jewelry needs to be truly taken care of so that it's always looking its best! Here's five awesome tips to keep your necklace shining:
<br><br>&nbsp;1. Gently clean the pendant and the chain with a soft cloth after taking it off or before putting it on. We even provide a Nominal Microfiber Pouch in every order! Doing this helps prevent any dust accumulating on the pendant chain, and will keep its shine at its brightest! As stated above, your necklace is permissible to go into water, so if it needs a little more cleaning than just a cloth, feel free to wipe it down with a moderate amount of warm water!
<br><br>&nbsp;2. Avoid sweat, perfume, chlorine, lotions, and oil. Even though our necklaces are rust-and-tarnish-free, some of these chemicals can cause a gold-plated piece to lose some of its color and sheen, so wear your necklace after spraying your favorite perfume or applying your lotion, and take it off before any physical exercise or the pool to make sure it lasts as long as possible!&nbsp;<br><br>3. Store your necklace in the soft Nominal Microfiber Pouch. Keeping the piece safe when it's not in use is a great idea. This keeps it away from scratching against other objects, and any potential accidents
<br><br>&nbsp;4. Lock the clasp together when not in use. Keeping the chain locked together, as if it is being worn, will help the chain avoid potential tangles which could damage the chain. Lock the clasp together when you store your necklace away and we hope that proves to be a good habit to get into!
<br><br>&nbsp;5. While we hope you love your necklace with all your heart, try avoiding wearing it in your sleep. With all the movement that can happen in sleep, jewelry like necklaces and bracelets can get tangled together and accidentally damage the chain or scratch the pendant. Take care of it by removing it before bed!</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kLwhqv julQCc pf-517_"><button type="button" class="sc-giYglK gvnqsv pf-518_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="a9ad41e0-ded3-48f8-a88e-a3e99ccfbec3" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>What is the Nominal Lifetime Warranty?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="a9ad41e0-ded3-48f8-a88e-a3e99ccfbec3" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-ezbkAF ikwrMb pf-520_"><p class="sc-xiLah fvOkQT pf-521_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-523_">Please read through some of our 13,000+ reviews. We are very proud to say that we have an average 4.8-star rating.   

Our famous Lifetime Warranty applies to all Nominal jewelry. No need to purchase a warranty or pay extra, it's included with all pieces, and you don't even need a receipt to file a claim for it.  Since day one, we've taken pride in our Lifetime Warranty and have become known for our all-encompassing policy. The truth is, we hate jewelry that fades. That's why we cover every single piece of jewelry with our Lifetime Warranty which covers color fading, tarnishing, rust, and any defects.  Now, of course, this doesn't mean you should be careless with your jewelry. 

In the rare instance that you've noticed some fading or tarnishing on your jewelry piece, please reach out to us at Support@Nominalx.com so that we can take care of you. Be sure to include the following:
<br><br>1. Your order number.
<br><br>2. A clear photo of your piece, closely focused on the faded spot.
<br><br>3. Your current shipping address.
<br><br>4. The name/color/details of your item, in case we are unable to discern the item from the photo.

If you are not entirely happy with your order, please contact us and we will do our best to make things right. <br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Your happiness is our #1 priority.</span></span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kLwhqv julQCc pf-524_"><button type="button" class="sc-giYglK gvnqsv pf-525_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="9816ce3d-6e57-4ba9-ad41-e0ded338f828" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>How does Nominal use their platform for good?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="9816ce3d-6e57-4ba9-ad41-e0ded338f828" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-ezbkAF ikwrMb pf-527_"><p class="sc-xiLah fvOkQT pf-528_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-530_">Every single order makes an impact now. Regardless of what you order from Nominal now, proceeds from every order will be donated to the campaign of the mont. We have always dreamed of using our platform for good, and it humbles us to see all of the support from the Nominal Family. Every dollar donated is from you, the Nominal Family, and all of the impact is yours. Thank you for being a part of this and allowing us to fulfill our duty in making a difference.<br><br>To date customers like you have donated over $400,000, provided food baskets to hungry people from all around the world, built a water well in Mali, and helped incarcerated men and women make genuine changes in their lives.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kLwhqv julQCc pf-531_"><button type="button" class="sc-giYglK gvnqsv pf-532_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="4ab080ef-fa3c-4998-96ce-3d6e57cba9ad" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Does Nominal have an app?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="4ab080ef-fa3c-4998-96ce-3d6e57cba9ad" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-ezbkAF ikwrMb pf-534_"><p class="sc-xiLah fvOkQT pf-535_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-537_">We absolutely do! You can download our official Nominal App for iOS and Android! This app features exclusive discounts, sneak peeks of upcoming launches, and sometimes we even do early access to brand new items so you can grab them before anyone else even sees them. And to top it all off, we provide the most seamless and lag-free shopping experience you've ever had. Enjoy!</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-2384" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-uojGG cmSGgF pf-538_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-ilfuhL bpQaoh"><div class="sc-ikJyIC iIcPdk pf-539_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fHeRUh hpWXZa pf-540_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-jUosCB gcYDfN pf-541_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-543_">Get Your Custom Necklace Today!</span></h3><p class="sc-xiLah fvOkQT pf-544_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-546_">Receive a Free Chain Extension and Free Shipping when you decide to take your personal necklace home today.</span></p><a href="https://nominalx.com/collections/custom/products/custom-name-necklace" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-jIkXHa euoiRq pf-547_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-549_"><span style="font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Check Availability</span></span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-36bb" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-uojGG cmSGgF pf-550_"><div style="--cw:700px" class="sc-ilfuhL bpQaoh"><div class="sc-ikJyIC iIcPdk pf-551_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:1